{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Pokémon: Hisuian Snow","Get ready for a new adventure set in the vast, stunning Hisui region, the location of Pokémon LEGENDS: Arceus. \n\n\nYuki Hodokishi Futaai tells the story of a boy named Akio and his encounter with a Hisuian Zorua. When he was younger, Akio's father taught him that people and Pokémon cannot live together. But Akio's interactions with the Zorua might offer a different lesson.\n\n\n(Source: Pokemon.com)"],"ja":["雪ほどきし二藍",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-51145","ids":{"shikimori":51145,"mal":51145,"anilist":145813,"kodik":"serial-79137"},"kodikIds":["serial-55541","serial-55544","serial-79137"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-55541":"2023-11-21T16:48:09Z","serial-55544":"2023-11-21T17:47:43Z","serial-79137":"2026-10-18T13:14:53Z"},"title":"Покемон: Хисуйский снег","originalTitle":"Yuki Hodokishi Futaai","alt":"Покемон: Гисуйский снег / Pokemon Legends Arceus: Yuki Hodo Kishi Futaai / Pokemon: Hisuian Snow Pokémon: Hisuian Snow 雪ほどきし二藍","description":"Аниме рассказывает историю мальчика по имени Акио и его встречи с гисуйской Зоруа. Когда Акио был маленьким, отец учил его, что люди и покемоны не могут жить вместе. Но общение с Зоруа, возможно, преподнесёт ему совсем другой урок.","year":2022,"type":"ONA","genres":["детское","Экшен","Приключения","Фэнтези"],"rating":7.41,"popularity":8919,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/51145/dd324c4d655d61aa60431eff3b56ad03.jpeg","width":740,"height":985},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/145813-PQtr1FOH2fmy.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-3193","dubId":"3193","label":"OnlyShiny","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","